      "Cloud Run tới Cloud SQL thường qua Cloud SQL Auth Proxy / Unix socket connector tích hợp Cloud Run, hoặc private IP / Serverless VPC Access tùy setup. App dùng connection string khớp connector; IAM và DB user vẫn apply.",
      "1) Tạo instance Cloud SQL; ghi connection name PROJECT:REGION:INSTANCE.\n2) Enable Cloud SQL connection trên service Cloud Run.\n3) Dùng DB user least privilege.\n4) Password trong Secret Manager.\n5) Test /health ping DB mà không lộ data.",
      "Opening Cloud SQL to 0.0.0.0/0 'temporarily' is a classic interview trap — say you wouldn't.",
